@AlefRichard
are you using regular maps or parallax mapping?
If the screen remains black on some devices but works on others that sounds as if those mobiles don't have enough RAM to load all pictures, and one of the biggest RAM-drains are parallaxed maps.

I was having some similar issues with repositories. I fixed them by changing the repositories order in my gradle files (make sure google is before jcenter):
repositories {
google()
jcenter()
}
instead of
repositories {
jcenter()
google()
}
Give it a try.

